---
config:
  layout: dagre
---
flowchart TD
    A([Client calls web_search query]) --> B

    B["**DuckDuckGo search**
    POST html.duckduckgo.com/html/
    Returns up to 8 URLs"]

    B --> C["**Slice URLs**
    Keep top MAX_PAGES_TO_FETCH = 5"]

    C --> D

    subgraph D["Page Fetching Loop"]
        D1["**GET page HTML**
        requests + BeautifulSoup"] --> D2["**Strip noise tags**
        script, style, nav, footer..."]
        D2 --> D3["**Extract plain text**
        Collapse whitespace → WebDocument"]
    end

    D --> E["**Chunk documents**
    size=600, overlap=150 → Chunk list
    Each chunk tagged source_id + URL"]

    E --> F

    subgraph F["Embedding-Based Ranking"]
        F1["**Embed query**
        Ollama nomic-embed-text"] --> F2["**Embed all chunks**
        Ollama nomic-embed-text"]
        F2 --> F3["**Cosine similarity**
        sklearn · rank all chunks"]
        F3 --> F4["**Select top-K chunks**
        top_k=6, max 2 per source"]
    end

    F --> G["**Build RAG context**
    Format chunks as S1…Sn with URLs"]

    G --> H["**Build final prompt**
    Question + RAG context + sources list"]

    H --> I["**Ollama LLM generate**
    Model: gemma3:12b · streaming"]

    I --> J["**Collect streamed response**
    Parse NDJSON lines → full_text"]

    J --> K["**Emit debug log**
    ToolProcessingEvent if debug_emit set"]

    K --> L([Return answer string])